WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Manchester, 1841. A demonstration attracts a surgeon.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The performers claim a magnetic force crossed the room.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
James Braid asks: what if attention explains the observation?

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
An observation may survive when its explanation fails.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Research still separates response from mechanism.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Twelve minutes is a duration. Not proof of a benefit.
